From 09b71e4fbf953bc2638907f48b8d81d3c9046b02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 02:53:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] init: separate prepared containers from legacy Floral FUSE

Keep host-prepared mount, SELinux and logging behavior separate from legacy
FUSE startup. Preserve all supplied arguments across init stages without
validating, filtering or freezing boot arguments and properties. Import
persist.* alongside the existing ro.* boot properties and split only the
first equals sign, preserving the complete value. Retain Android's
normal property checks and persistent-property loading order.

Signed-off-by: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
---
